## User Flow

```
Register → Account created (is_verified=False)
         → Verification link printed to backend console (dev mode)
         → User clicks link → /verify-email?token=...
         → Token validated → is_verified=True
         → User can now log in

Login (unverified) → HTTP 403 "Email not verified"
                   → "Resend Email" button appears in LoginPage
```

