## How to Test Manually

1. **Start backend**: run `uvicorn backend.main:app --reload` from the `backend/` directory
2. **Register** a new user via the frontend signup page or `POST /api/v1/auth/register`
3. **Check backend console** for the verification link (printed with `📧 [EMAIL DISPATCH - DEV MODE]`)
4. **Visit the link** in your browser: `http://localhost:5173/verify-email?token=<TOKEN>`
5. **Click "Continue to Login"** and log in with your credentials

> [!TIP]
> To set up real SMTP for production, add `SMTP_HOST`, `SMTP_PORT`, `SMTP_USER`, `SMTP_PASSWORD` to your `.env` file.
